    "title": "DSP8 nodal trace-orbit energy router",
    "status": "PROVED",
    "closure": "proof",
    "statement": "Internally signed-distinct points on each singular trace form free six-presentation orbits, and signed-disjoint DSP8 pairs cannot lie in one orbit. Thus the nodal pair square sharpens exactly to E_tr=sum_c N_c(N_c-6). When p=1 mod 3, E_tr=(N^2+2|S|^2)/3-6N for one cubic-character bias S of the eligible nodal parameters. This is an exact energy router; it proves no cubic-bias or smooth-trace bound.",
